{"abstract":"Taking a critical approach, this book advances understanding of the social, legal and ethical aspects of digitalisation in law enforcement and the reliance on data-driven tools to predict and prevent crime. It shows how the proliferation of data analytics challenges citizens’ rights, at a time when what counts as ‘safety’ or ‘policing’ is being fundamentally transformed.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Galis, Vasilis","Oppen Ingebrigtsen Gundhus, Helene","Vradis, Antonis"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-798565"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Oslo","University of St Andrews"],"keyword":["Big data","Critical criminology","Digital policing","Law enforcement","Predictive policing","Surveillance"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"critical perspectives on predictive policing anticipating proof","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4337/9781035323036","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-798565","identifier":[{"id":"105004486828","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-e7750171-8895-4d47-a730-3819785ba135"],"keyword":["Big data","Crime forecasting","Critical criminology","Digital policing","Law enforcement","Predictive policing","Surveillance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-4-5-AA0BB3B63F55270DAFE021F87B9FD968"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4337/9781035323036","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-